GmACBP4.1
-transformed roots and +94% in
GmACBP4.2
-transformed roots (
Figure 9, C
). To confirm the inhibition of VLXB activity by GmACBP4.1 interaction, recombinant VLXB:StrepII and GmACBP4.1
33–354
(WT and Y135A mutant) were used for in vitro enzyme assays (
