Nicotiana
benthamiana
and transgenic Arabidopsis expressing GmACBP3.1:EGFP (pGM947), GmACBP3.2:EGFP (pGM961), GmACBP3.3:EGFP (pGM960), GmACBP4.1:EGFP (pGM948), GmACBP4.2:EGFP (pGM962), DsRed:VLXB (pGM1024), and DsRed:AtLOX1 (pAT1025) were examined with a Zeiss LSM 710 NLO confocal laser scanning microscope. Arabidopsis seedlings were stained with 1 μM Invitrogen ER-Tracker Red (catalog no. E34250) and Green (catalog no.
