Strep-Tactin pull-down assays were performed using Strep-Tactin XT resins (IBA) following the manufacturer’s instructions. Briefly, 5 μL of resins with/without prebound VLXB:StrepII or GmPLDα1:StrepII (0.5 μM) were agitated with GmACBP4.1
